        "original_id": "eb874bb4-8456-5391-9dbb-3359436448c9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dominique Wilkins\n- Organizations: Atlanta Hawks, Boston Celtics, NBA All-Star\n- Events: 1994–95 Atlanta Hawks season, offseason, January 4\n- Concepts: NBA history, dunking, nickname\n\nFacts:\n- In the offseason before the 1994–95 Atlanta Hawks season, Dominique Wilkins signed with the Boston Celtics.\n- Without Dominique Wilkins, the Atlanta Hawks lost their first four games of the 1994–95 season.\n- As of January 4 in the 1994–95 season, the Atlanta Hawks held a 12–19 record.\n- Dominique Wilkins was a nine-time NBA All-Star.\n- Dominique Wilkins was widely viewed as one of the best dunkers in NBA history.\n- Dominique Wilkins earned the nickname \"The Human Highlight Film.\"",
